# Expo prebuild output. Generated from app.json by `expo prebuild` and never
# edited by hand — committing it would mean maintaining native projects
# manually, which is the thing continuous native generation exists to avoid.
# It is also ~900 MB of build artefacts. Note that `expo run:android` skips
# prebuild when this directory already exists, so an app.json change needs an
# explicit `expo prebuild` to reach the native config.
apps/mobile/android/
apps/mobile/ios/
